n            <div class=\"w-full flex gap-2 px-2\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533636721434-0e2d61030955?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w0NzEyNjZ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw1fHxibGFjayUyMHByb2ZpbGUlMjBpbWFnZXxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzEzNTMwNjg5fDA&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&q=80&w=1080\" alt=\"User profile\" class=\"w-[3.4rem] h-[3.4rem] rounded-full\" />\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                    <h4 class=\"text-md text-gray-800 font-semibold dark:text-gray-200\">Eyasu Abera</h4>\n                    <h6 class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">System Administrator</h6>\n                    <!-- follow Button -->\n                    <div class=\"w-fit px-3 flex justify-center items-center border border-black my-2 rounded-full dark:border-gray-200 dark:text-white\">\n                        <i class=\"fa fa-lock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n                        <h5 class=\"pl-1\">Message</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-full flex gap-2 px-2\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1678483790053-71367bc7a02c?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w0NzEyNjZ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw5fHxnb29nbGUlMjBsb2dvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3MzIyNTc3MTF8MA&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&q=80&w=1080\" alt=\"User profile\" class=\"w-[3.4rem] h-[3.4rem] rounded-full\" />\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                    <h4 class=\"text-md text-gray-800 font-semibold dark:text-gray-200\">Google</h4>\n                    <h6 class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Software Development</h6>\n                    <!-- follow Button -->\n                    <div class=\"w-fit px-3 flex justify-center items-center border border-black my-2 rounded-full dark:border-gray-200 dark:text-white\">\n                        <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">add</span>\n                        <h5 class=\"\">Follow</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"w-full flex gap-1 px-4 pb-2 \">\n                <h6 class=\"text-md text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">View all recommendations</h6>\n                <span class=\"material-symbols-outlined dark:text-gray-300\">arrow_right_alt</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>    \n</div>"
